# Searches (S4.2c): queued as jobs, polled by id. A queued search runs once the worker exists (S4.3).
# Set apiKey to the key the Ingest's add-user printed; don't commit a key.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = sp_paste-your-key-here

### Find similar: one FASTA record; viruses of comparable length (ratio 0.5: half to twice the query's length)
# @name similar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/searches/similar?kind=virus&ratio=0.5&top=20
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: text/x-fasta

< ./query.fna

### Poll it: status, and once Done the first page of ranked hits
GET {{baseUrl}}{{similar.response.headers.Location}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Identical records (same sequence by SHA-256, either strand)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{similar.response.headers.Location}}?list=Identical
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Next page of ranked hits: after = the previous page's nextAfter
GET {{baseUrl}}{{similar.response.headers.Location}}?after=50&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Find similar from a profile: the forward strand's 500 bp ZCWP, then the reverse strand's, back to back
# (the Ingest's profile command writes X.zcwp and X.rc.zcwp: cat X.zcwp X.rc.zcwp > X.both.zcwp)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/searches/similar?lengthBp=29903
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/x-zcwp

< ./query.both.zcwp

### Localize a fragment (at least 4 kbp) over the catalogue's bacteria
# @name localize
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/searches/localize?kind=bacterium&top=10
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: text/x-fasta

< ./fragment.fna

### Poll it
GET {{baseUrl}}{{localize.response.headers.Location}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Localize a short fragment inside one record (yours or public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/searches/localize?record=1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: text/x-fasta

< ./gene.fna

### Drop a search's query profile and results now (D7); it stays listed as Expired
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{similar.response.headers.Location}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Error: a fragment under 4 kbp over the whole catalogue (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/searches/localize
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: text/x-fasta

>short
ACGTACGTACGTACGTACGTACGTACGTACGTACGTACGT
